                                "sense_id": "96693e57-0225-390c-aae9-585d4ac6df53",
                                "text": "O now for euer / Farewell the tranquile mind, farewell content: / Farewell the plumed troope, and the big warres: / That makes ambition vertue: [...]"
                            },
