                                "sense_id": "96693e57-0225-390c-aae9-585d4ac6df53",
                                "text": "Is there no Albyn now to wake thy song, / No chiefs who still their fathers' worth retain, / No plumed and plaided clans those hills among, / Worthy to claim the tribute of thy strain?"
                            }
                        ]
